Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move to Earth's horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find infinity for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's save all this blue sea and\Nlet the wind Take us far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can come back to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.02,0:00:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can be present right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw away this drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes we share.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be so afraid to podcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,To have a friend right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will always be here by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the darkest of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try looking brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the ones who\Nare meant to rule them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move to our same horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find insanity for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a world from our head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We will win for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move to the worst day horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We will fight however we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to be the best we will run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To the top, to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta be the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.38,0:01:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause just keep dreaming on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never stop cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.86,0:01:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta give everything I got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of the greatest of all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find infinite fortunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We will step ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We will wait for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.78,0:01:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So keep moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in and capture Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Channel the Hock!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow through my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.08,0:02:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.28,0:02:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna send you to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I was still off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitting Kaido with Haki from\Nthe outside isn't gonna cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just hit the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to let Haki flow into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not power, it's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's scales are too\Ntough to just punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way I can break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's still way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't screw with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That punch didn't feel right either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Need you guys to line up\Nso I can figure this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll master Ryo and Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.94,0:03:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing gets Mr. Straw Hat down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper Emon, shall we make our way down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go and rescue Olin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.19,0:03:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rescue who now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about that lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'm glad that we lost her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy Daddy needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her, Kiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he trying to run\Nyet? Let's go! All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden, what if the prisoners rebel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we get them back in\Ntheir cells while we still can?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.34,0:04:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sticking it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's crazy strong. It's unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking we should\Nmake a break for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.95,0:04:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the guards have taken off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.04,0:04:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One poison drives out another, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and get ready, Difugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making the call. Oh, yeah? You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.24,0:04:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, inmates! Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend Lufitato is a wild animal\Nwho wants to tear this prison apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.56,0:04:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are going to bring him to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that guy talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you still refuse to fall in line,\Nyou all know what comes next. Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to live through this,\Nthen capture Luffy Toto this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you actually think that this will work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys aren't gonna listen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I want your side, you bunch of dopes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, it's not like we're\Nrooting for the guards here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to do this, but\Nwe don't have much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got our hopes up that\Nwe saw you fight back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if we do manage\Nto break out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi's still in charge,\Nso what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides that, we already tried to revenge\NLord Odin once and ended up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard Kaido's way too tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, we've lost our\Nfamilies and comrades, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's beaten us into submission\Nwith little hope for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing you fight back was amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:06:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but Lord Yasui's execution brought back\Nall that fear and despair from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we do manage to break out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,what's the point when we'll\Njust be homeless and starving?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Wano will\Nnever be free again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so we might as well just give up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wise decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll obey us if you don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let them go, you selfish jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's being selfish! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As an outsider from overseas, you\Ncan run and fight all you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's your choice to make!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't expect us to\Nback you up! We're tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give us false hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just so cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to get you help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:07:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you should worry more\Nabout yourself than each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.22,0:07:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm burning! It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me! Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this green crab?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you what happened\Nif you stepped out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What I just fired at you was\Na highly contagious play.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,One touch and you're\Ngoing to get infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let those poor bastards\Nserve as an example in case
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the rest of you decide you\Nwant to try something funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Master Queen has a hobby\Nof creating weapons and viruses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a taste of what he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,these are master queen's special\Nplaygrounds who else wants to test them out
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.06,0:07:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat i can't help but wonder why you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,thought the prisoners\Nwould ever rally behind
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you their will to resist dried up long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're about to suffer\Nalong with them like
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,hell i am i dare you to try and shoot me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't you hear what i\Nsaid you can get infected
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,by those around you\Neven if i don't hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone listen you guys gotta spread out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,what does it matter so what if we die\Nhere maybe it's for the best i can't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,explain right now but trust me i can fix\Nthings for you say your prayers Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Boy Be their beacon of hope\NLet them know the fire of rebellion
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,still burns We've been given one\Nlast chance Kaido can be defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.68,0:08:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a voice coming from\Nthe never-opening cell Guess
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:09:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,he's still kicking after all\NThere's a person in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No one told you what was inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no man and it's no animal, but\Nit's proven to be quite the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan was to keep\Nfeeding him fish from the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,factory's polluted water\Nrunoff until he died in agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was quite resilient, as those\Norders came from the Shogun 13 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It was intended to be a slow and\Npainful death, but he hung on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, we let this\Ngo on for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The prisoner inside of that cell is\Nnone other than one of the Akazaya Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought they all died out long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll call it an accidental death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No question, it's Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you take a look at this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:10:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That slimy little freak is a\Nmember of the famous Akazaya 9?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's mine, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.22,0:10:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell? A needle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a fishbone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Slime will protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The huge-headed guy got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your keys and your sword are incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Impeccable timing. I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Been far too long, my trusty old blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sotomousso.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like sumo wrestling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.46,0:11:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Akariwa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Still just as tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Kawamatsu, you lose\Nif your feet leave the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,things were.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A flash of steel at the\Nblowing rapids of a river.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They call it Kappa style.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.52,0:12:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,River of Retribution!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I found those\Npoisonous fish a delicacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, rather they were so vile that my\Ninnards twisted and begged for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, I stood firm for 13 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to my lord's suffering,\Nit was barely a drop in a pond.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Long have I waited, but the time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu the Kappa has\Njoined this epic crusade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku! Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that you are free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo, same to you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku, you're here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone know who the short\Nguy with a swollen head is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an intruder, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.04,0:13:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who stole the sword and cup\Nkeys, I don't know how he got in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't just stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something about him, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the heck did you turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That was 13 years of bad fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the playgrounds ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish them off before\Nthis gets out of hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone prepare for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I demand you release Sir Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy Oh kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.91,0:14:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me your boss yogurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's you who should speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell them\Nwho you really are?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to inspire\Nthose with broken spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you must remove your disguise\Nand reveal your identities!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.12,0:14:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They once fought for our cause, so\NI'm certain their passion will return!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How true!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's earn their trust before proceeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.22,0:14:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen close!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not mere ghosts or memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.96,0:14:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The legends are true!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! That mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.58,0:15:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It belongs to the most beautiful\Nswordsman in all of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he died at Oden Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it really be Kiku\NNojo of the Fallen Snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a woman at my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The mask, yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Fukurokuju's rival\Nninja, Raizo of the Mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai there is the most\Npowerful sumo wrestler ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And the old man is who\Nwe suspected all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Yoguro the Flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One question, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this Luffy Taro guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that? He is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This leads me to believe Lord\NOrochi's ramblings were true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to report this\Nto Commander Kaido somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you have seen us, thy\Nlips must be sealed forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.22,0:16:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico, flower shooting kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavy gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come! Got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, try these playgrounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We keep missing him with the bullets, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, hit someone close to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.26,0:17:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They've suffered enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting with a virus is\Nthe lowest of the low!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta go to us first\Nto get to the general.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's break through, chopper! On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, gong gong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavy! He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave my comrades alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.24,0:18:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I second that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kappa style.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Norikiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.08,0:18:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninpou, lightning shuriken!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:18:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, friends of Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One of those should set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.12,0:19:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns! It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.92,0:19:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.30,0:19:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The prisoners don't deserve this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what horror awaits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The plague starts with a burning\Nsensation from the bullet wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.74,0:20:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the pain spreads to every corner of\Nyour body until your blood bursts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The victim is left in agony, twisting\Nand crawling in search of relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And in doing so, they infect\Nanyone they come in contact with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Great mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfect example of\Nhow this stuff spreads!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever see a human being\Nshrivel up like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They look like a bunch\Nof rotting old weeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.44,0:20:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.68,0:20:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Back up or you'll infect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called the mummy play. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It truly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.76,0:21:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Master queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Finest work!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.74,0:21:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all of you are human weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,One little touch and you\Ncan share your suffering!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.84,0:21:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take another step closer to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll spread the virus even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me some time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.70,0:21:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find a cure for you, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.84,0:21:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure you want to oppose me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.14,0:21:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens\Nto rebels, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems they have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.64,0:21:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.08,0:21:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All of Udon Prison is fighting against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape all you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.46,0:22:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and you shouldn't have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.40,0:22:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this sort of habit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you're\Nthe legendary Akisaya samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.84,0:22:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They outpower us in every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.12,0:22:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how you look\Nat it, you'll never win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.68,0:22:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up against the worst of the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon who blacks out the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus he has the beast\Npirates to back him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.58,0:22:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No one stands a chance against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please just take a look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.92,0:22:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All of this chaos unleashed\Nby one weapon made by.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,one of Kaido's men,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.94,0:23:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,utter devastation, utter despair,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and Kaido never raised a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you outsiders hadn't invaded, at least\Nwe could have carried on with our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it was miserable,\Nit wasn't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't past the point of no return.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't have to suffer this nightmare,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.18,0:23:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,watching our own bodies shrivel\Nup and eat themselves alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.90,0:23:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch them, Lufitaro! You'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.26,0:23:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this crap right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.18,0:23:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he'll be infected too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.18,0:24:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can't convince me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.56,0:24:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarno Future, why would you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.16,0:24:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.66,0:24:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can't convince me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.76,0:24:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this tower can't be beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.76,0:24:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.18,0:24:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't hurt me at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.22,0:24:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.62,0:24:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.42,0:24:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.08,0:24:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get away from this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.36,0:25:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to break your\Nspirit, but you gotta listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.98,0:25:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai I met are really tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.92,0:25:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fighting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.48,0:25:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has to pull together!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.22,0:25:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You talk about your life here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.26,0:25:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Like slaving away for dumplings is a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.96,0:25:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You give it just enough\Nso you don't keel over!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.38,0:25:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's what life is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.70,0:26:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around you, a bunch of slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.80,0:26:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worth more!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.28,0:26:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.46,0:26:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro and his friends are okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.78,0:26:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.80,0:26:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And so what if I'm not\Nfrom the land of Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.26,0:26:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.26,0:26:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so wrong to\Nget help from me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.72,0:26:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise I got to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.30,0:27:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a friend named Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.70,0:27:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She made sure I could eat even\Nwhen she had nothing herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.14,0:27:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So I owe it to her to make this country a
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.98,0:27:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,place where she can fill\Nher belly every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.20,0:27:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make this a normal thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.62,0:27:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear that by the time we leave Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.54,0:27:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be a place where you can\Neat as much as you want every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.72,0:27:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.08,0:27:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I do, you'll be trapped\Nin this living hell forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.70,0:27:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.68,0:27:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already heard about Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.78,0:27:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like an amazing guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.46,0:28:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But when Kaido killed him 20 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.90,0:28:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,everything in this country\Ncame to a complete standstill.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.38,0:28:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have to remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.70,0:28:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me and my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.78,0:28:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll beat Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.26,0:28:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.28,0:28:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for our own\Nallies to stand in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.16,0:28:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So make up your minds right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.62,0:28:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.58,0:28:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you with Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.34,0:28:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You really mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.62,0:29:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, you're not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.94,0:29:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're giving this another shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.82,0:29:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's winning everyone over, that\Nman can sure capture a heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.88,0:29:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems like you guys\Nare going weak on me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.48,0:29:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter, I can still sway you to\Nmy side with a little crowd control.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.42,0:29:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one shot in the middle, then\Neverything will turn to chaos again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.98,0:29:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to break out the big one—how\Ndoes 200 times the amount sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.00,0:29:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,sound Here comes your plague shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.42,0:29:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.04,0:29:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A plague-packed elephant smart shoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.54,0:30:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't do this, warden!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.02,0:30:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.86,0:30:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.96,0:30:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Baba Nuki's going to\Nfire something this way. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.36,0:30:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.66,0:30:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.50,0:30:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant smart shoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now sneeze smart shoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.44,0:30:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.20,0:30:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! No! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.54,0:30:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Had to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.36,0:30:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The future I saw took a bad turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.42,0:30:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.80,0:30:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.14,0:31:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, let it go, no game!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.84,0:31:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.80,0:31:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.74,0:31:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What a capable fellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.56,0:31:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Handle the rest for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.12,0:31:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us. Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.92,0:31:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in charge. Take it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.56,0:31:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what happens to\Nanyone who defies a jailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.40,0:31:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,First defense is you lose your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.86,0:31:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We know, but we don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.32,0:31:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Call us rebels, but\Nwe've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.20,0:31:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for\Nour years of suffering!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.51,0:31:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Get her! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.51,0:32:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight days remain before\Nthe great battle begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.19,0:32:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's main forces\Nare still oblivious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.35,0:32:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Udon has been conquered. Mr. Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.23,0:32:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That was magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.77,0:32:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to admit you found\None hell of an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.07,0:32:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kin'emon.
